        "cooked": "<p>This is the next team vs team battle that I am going to do , after this is I guess single fights , ect but we will see .<br><strong>Rules for the battle </strong></p><ol>\n<li>Both sides are in character</li>\n<li>Both sides have teir standard gear / wear</li>\n<li>Morals are on for both sides</li>\n<li>Both sides think the otherare villians</li>\n<li>Both sides are the standard version and / or team version</li>\n</ol><p><strong>Dark Watch </strong></p><ol>\n<li>Set back</li>\n<li>Mr . Fixer</li>\n<li>Night mist / Harpy</li>\n<li>Expatriette</li>\n</ol><p><strong>The Sentinels</strong></p><ol>\n<li>MainStay</li>\n<li>Dr . Medico</li>\n<li>Writhe</li>\n<li>The idealist</li>\n</ol><p><strong>Location for the Batttle </strong><br>Megalopolis</p><p><strong>Round 1</strong> - Night Mist<br><strong>Round 2 </strong>- Harpy</p>",
